Spend some quality time.

575
00:40:08.206 --> 00:40:10.709
I'm sure he'd really like that.

576
00:40:10.742 --> 00:40:12.711
Yeah. And hey, when I come
back down, you wanna watch

577
00:40:12.744 --> 00:40:14.746
