It's Emma's famous soup.
Your favorite dish.

588
00:40:52.818 --> 00:40:55.954
Too bad you can't
eat it yourself.

589
00:40:57.823 --> 00:41:01.560
Mm! God that's good.

590
00:41:01.593 --> 00:41:04.663
Oh my God, Dad.
I had the best night last night.

591
00:41:04.696 --> 00:41:06.765
I figured I'd tell you
