592
00:41:06.798 --> 00:41:08.667
You're such a good listener now.

593
00:41:08.700 --> 00:41:11.036
First off, I got laid!
(Drum roll sound.)

594
00:41:11.069 --> 00:41:13.238
And while it wasn't
the best I ever had,

595
00:41:13.271 --> 00:41:17.208
