632
00:43:35.747 --> 00:43:37.816
Goodbye, Daddy.

633
00:43:52.964 --> 00:43:55.433
Oh, just leave all that, Emma.
I'm going to get us some wine.

634
00:43:55.466 --> 00:43:58.203
- Go inside and relax.
- Aw, really?

635
00:43:58.236 --> 00:44:00.972
- Yeah, of course.
- Oh, thank you.

636
00:44:01.006 --> 00:44:03.274
'Course.

637
