1136
01:17:42.225 --> 01:17:45.461
Then you found out how much
he was leaving you in the will.

1137
01:17:45.494 --> 01:17:49.766
You were so devastated that you
swallowed this entire bottle

1138
01:17:49.799 --> 01:17:51.968
