breaking a few eggs, right?

1173
01:19:45.348 --> 01:19:47.917
I never did like Laura.

1174
01:19:47.951 --> 01:19:51.020
She was always
Daddy's little angel.

1175
01:19:51.054 --> 01:19:54.523
Come to think of it,

1176
